# Every cycle appends an entry to the log. Without a union merge, two branches
# that each appended one conflict on every merge — the entries never overlap, so
# keeping both sides is always the right resolution. The merged entries can land
# out of stamp order; the feature-branching skill restores it. (todos.md is
# deliberately NOT union-merged: a removed todo line could be resurrected by it.)
docs/wiki/log.md merge=union
